Section STC.
Variables (szc cnt : Z).
Hypothesis SZC : 1 <= szc <= 8191.
Hypothesis CR : 1 <= cnt <= 32.
Hypothesis SMALL : szc * 16 * cnt + 16 <= 2048.
Let n' := szc * 16 * cnt + 12.
Let j := size_to_class n'.

